special_abilities:
  - { name: "Orientation A: Hunter/Thief", description: "Trained in tracking and hunting or spying and stealing; usually fast and/or with enhanced senses. Roll or, at the G.M.''s discretion, select three augmentations from Table 4 (Sensory Enhancement), one from Table 3 (Long-Range Offensive Ability), and either Enhanced Spd or Enhanced P.P. from Table 5. Also select four skills total from the Espionage category and/or either the Wilderness or Rogue categories, each with a +10% bonus (added by hand: the picks are not modelled)." }
