  - { name: "Orientation D: Guardian", description: "Designed for defense: mutated to superhuman size with great strength and endurance, but slow and uneducated. Roll or, at the G.M.''s discretion, select one augmentation from Table 1 (re-rolling incompatible results), two from Table 2, and either Big and Strong (Table 1, 11-18; the book calls it Super-Size and Strength) or the Titanizer (Symbiote) from Table 5. Starts with the Physical Enhancement of Supernatural Strength (P.S. 40). Add the Wrestling skill, but reduce all other skills -5%. I.Q. is reduced by 1D6 (maximum 10) and the Spd attribute is halved (maximum 12); the maximums and the halving are applied by hand.", bonuses: { attributes: { IQ: "-1d6" }, attribute_minimums: { PS: 40 } } }
